Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Notifications|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Notifications|
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
		|portletName|Message Boards|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Message Boards|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|password|password|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	Then User assign Regular Role CP
		|roleTitle|Administrator|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View No Website Notification For New Thread In Category
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	When NotificationsPortlet goto Notification Delivery
	And IFrame select Configuration Frame
	And NotificationsPortlet disable User Deliveries
		|actionType|Adds|
		|contentType|Message Boards|
		|notificationType|Website|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And MessageboardsCategory add PG
		|categoryName|MB Category Name|
	And MessageboardsCategory subscribe PG
		|categoryName|MB Category Name|
	And Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And MessageboardsCategory goto PG
		|categoryName|MB Category Name|
	And MessageboardsThread add PG
		|threadBody|MB Thread Message Body|
		|threadSubject|MB Thread Message Subject|
	And Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
	Then Notifications view Badge Count
		|notificationCount|0|
